window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I'd never even kissed a boy the night I met Stone. The night I saw him kill. The night he spared my life. That was only the beginning.</p> <p>He turns up in my car again and again, dangerous and full of raw power. \"Drive,\" he tells me, and I have no choice. He's a criminal with burning green eyes, invading my life and my dreams.</p> <p>The police say he's dangerously obsessed with me, but I'm the one who can't stop thinking about him. </p> <p>Maybe, it's wrong to let him touch me. Maybe, it's wrong to touch him back. Maybe, these twisted dates need to stop. Except, he feels like the only real thing in my world of designer labels and mansions. So, I drive us under threat, until it's hard to remember I don't want to be there. Until it's too late to turn back...</p> <p><i>Hostage </i>is a dangerous stand-alone romance by <i>The New York Times</i> best-selling authors Skye Warren and Annika Martin. It's set in the same world as <i>Prisoner</i>, but can be listened to separately!</p> <p>\"Deliciously sexy, emotionally gripping...<i>Hostage </i>rocked my whole world.\" (Marni Mann, author of <i>Prisoned</i>) </p> <p>\"Fast paced and oh so addicting!\" (Rachel Van Dyken, number one The New York Times best-selling author) </p>"; 
